    "When a new worker finishes their 2-week training, do they become a \"skilled worker\" who can themselves train new workers, or do they remain a separate category (paid 240 yuan/week) that can only produce and never train?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the status and capabilities of workers after training, presented as a binary alternative."
}

